From: Rodrigo Belem <rodrigo.belem@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:45:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] niri: add the backend of the GlobalShortcuts portal

xdg-desktop-portal serves the public GlobalShortcuts interface to
applications and forwards the requests to a compositor-provided backend.
Implement that backend: it owns org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.niri,
serves org.freedesktop.impl.portal.GlobalShortcuts on
/org/freedesktop/portal/desktop, and keeps the sessions and the bound
shortcuts on the compositor's main loop.

The state lives on the main loop because deciding whether a shortcut may be
bound requires the binds from the user's config, which the D-Bus thread
cannot read.
